error[B0402]: `seen` is a `var`, and a closure cannot capture it
 --> check/captured_var.bloom:6:5
  |
4 |   var seen = 0
  |       ---- declared here
  |
6 |     seen += 1
  |     ^^^^ captured here
  |
help: bind its value to a `let` before the closure, or make it `@state` (a function's own `var` may be captured; a view's render and a hook function's may not)
  = docs: https://github.com/OxyHQ/Bloom/blob/main/docs/bloom-lang-spec.mdx#43-soundness-rules

error[B0402]: `seen` is a `var`, and a closure cannot capture it
 --> check/captured_var.bloom:7:12
  |
4 |   var seen = 0
  |       ---- declared here
  |
7 |     return seen
  |            ^^^^ captured here
  |
help: bind its value to a `let` before the closure, or make it `@state` (a function's own `var` may be captured; a view's render and a hook function's may not)
  = docs: https://github.com/OxyHQ/Bloom/blob/main/docs/bloom-lang-spec.mdx#43-soundness-rules
